^ USB              | No                                                               |
^ Serial           | [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial.cables|Yes]], [[#serial|settings]]   |
^ JTAG             | [[docs:techref:hardware:port.jtag.cables|Yes]]                           |


==== Serial ====
Connect on UART (J2). P1 is closest to the NAND, and P4 is closest to the SoC.

| **P1:** VCC   |
| **P2:** RX    |
| **P3:** TX    |
| **P4:** GND   |

